<body>
<h1>Reactivation Sequence — segment: <code>&lt;SEGMENT&gt;</code></h1>
<ul><li><strong>Spec ID:</strong> <code>dlr-&lt;YYYY&gt;q&lt;n&gt;-&lt;segment&gt;</code></li><li><strong>Owner:</strong> <code>@&lt;handle&gt;</code></li><li><strong>Version:</strong> <code>1.0.0</code></li><li><strong>Total contacts:</strong> <code>&lt;N&gt;</code></li></ul>
<h2>Touch 1 (day 0)</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Channel:</strong> email | linkedin | phone</li><li><strong>Subject:</strong> Reference prior interaction explicitly</li><li><strong>Body draft:</strong><ul><li>References: <code>&lt;project / proposal-date / topic&gt;</code> (rule prior-context-reference)</li><li>Tone: warm, specific, non-salesy</li><li>For EU/UK/CA contacts with consent_age &gt; 18m: this is the consent re-confirmation (rule consent-reconfirm-first-touch)</li></ul></li></ul>
<h2>Touch 2 (day +10)</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Channel:</strong> email | linkedin</li><li><strong>Subject:</strong> Offer / value reference</li><li><strong>Body draft:</strong><ul><li>Specific value tied to prior interaction</li><li>One CTA (call / pilot / review)</li></ul></li></ul>
<h2>Touch 3 (day +24)</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Channel:</strong> email</li><li><strong>Subject:</strong> Polite close</li><li><strong>Body draft:</strong><ul><li>&quot;Last note this quarter&quot;</li><li>Opt-in to long-term nurture or remove from list</li><li>Rule max-3-touches: NEVER schedule touch 4</li></ul></li></ul>
<h2>Outcome tracking</h2>
<p>Per contact:</p>
<ul><li>[ ] engaged</li><li>[ ] killed</li><li>[ ] pending (auto-converts to killed at quarter end)</li></ul>
